[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7866.629, "timestamp": "02:11:06", "text": "衣櫃似乎說了些什麼，然後突然就消失了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7871.83, "timestamp": "02:11:11", "text": "。  嗯，這件事我們以後再處理。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7874.55, "timestamp": "02:11:14", "text": "好的。然後，一切就都好了。呃，下一個是斯特凡。  範，小心點，拿回你的錢。夥計"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7882.79, "timestamp": "02:11:22", "text": "們，小心！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7891.91, "timestamp": "02:11:31", "text": "我覺得我的錢被偷了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7893.27, "timestamp": "02:11:33", "text": "。  我看得出來。我完全看得出來。  糟糕。我的錯。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7894.95, "timestamp": "02:11:34", "text": "不是故意要弄翻它的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7899.109, "timestamp": "02:11:39", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7901.75, "timestamp": "02:11:41", "text": "我當時想，呃，這對我來說稍微遠了一點。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7907.99, "timestamp": "02:11:47", "text": "我不太喜歡靠得那麼近。  我到底該怎麼辦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7918.709, "timestamp": "02:11:58", "text": "呃，我的"}]